{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方最大号的白色标题“回去未必找回亲近，他仍想：万一能呢?”，随后紫色大字和下方灰白大字也会争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他考虑回去，但知道回去未必能重新找回亲近，仍然抱着一丝可能性。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"有所期待、舍不得、犹豫，对结果没有把握。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他害怕独自承担、心里没底，以及想先把眼下过稳却不收回回去打算的矛盾；不愿仅凭期待回去忍让的态度也需要再看一眼。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：顶部标题、紫色强调句、下方灰白大字都很突出。\",\n    \"下方大句一块里包含先稳住眼下、害怕独自承担、心里没底、不收回打算几层意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e39d8f9b-facc-4429-9516-ea36d45f3bcf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T023157139275Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:32:54.542133+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5524ddbdcfb0346126967e6402b5d605c0e3adddb8443ba5e556591a39a19ed8", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf